<sect2 id="gimp-prefs-new-image">
  <title>Preferências da imagem padrão</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Imagem</primary>
    <secondary>Preferências</secondary>
    <tertiary>Imagem resultante</tertiary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Salvar imagem</primary>
    <secondary>Configuração padrão</secondary>
  </indexterm>

  <anchor id="gimp-prefs-default-image"/>
  <figure>
    <title>Preferências da nova imagem padrão</title>
    <mediaobject>
      <imageobject>
        <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/preferences/prefs-default-new-image.png"/>
      </imageobject>
    </mediaobject>
  </figure>
  <para>
    This page lets you customize the default settings for the New Image
    dialog.
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o diálogo</title>
    <para>
      The preferences dialog can be accessed from the main menu, through
      <menuchoice>
       <guimenu>Edit</guimenu>
       <guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>Opções</title>
    <variablelist>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Modelo</term>
        <term>Image Size</term>
        <term>Opções avançadas</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            See the <link linkend="gimp-file-new">New Image Dialog</link>
            section for an explanation of what each option means.
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Quick Mask color</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            This lets you define the color used to represent the
            <link linkend="gimp-quick-mask">Quick mask</link>
            selection.
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
